l analysis of gene expression</article-title><source>Science</source><year>1995</year><volume>270</volume><fpage>484</fpage><lpage>487</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7570003</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1126/science.270.5235.484</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Liang</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Pardee</surname><given-names>AB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Differential display of eukaryotic messenger RNA by means of the polymerase chain reaction</article-title><source>Science</source><year>1992</year><volume>257</volume><fpage>967</fpage><lpage>971</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1354393</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1126/science.1354393</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Adams</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name><name><surname>Kerlavage</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Fields</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Venter</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>3400 new expressed sequence tags identify diversity of transcripts in human brain</article-title><source>Nat Genet</source><year>1993</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>256</fpage><lpage>267</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8358434</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/ng0793-256</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tassanakajon</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Klinbunga</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Paunglarp</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Rimphanitchayakit</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Udomkit</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Jitrapakdee</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sritunyalucksana</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Phongdara</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Pongsomboon</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Supungul</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Tang</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuphanumart</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Pichyangkura</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Lursinsap</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title><italic>Penaeus monodon </italic>gene discovery project: the generation of an EST collection and establishment of a database</article-title><source>Gene</source><year>2006</year><volume>384</volume><fpage>104</fpage><lpage>112</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16945489</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.gene.2006.07.012</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Okubo</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Hori</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Matoba</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Nuyama</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Fukushima</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Kojima</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Matsubara</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Large scale cDNA sequencing for analysis of quantitative and qualitative aspects of gene expression</article-title><source>Nat Genet</source><year>1992</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>173</fpage><lpage>179</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1345164</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/ng1192-173</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title><italic>E. superba </italic>database</